nfirmed example, color 3 extended up-right from its exposed endpoint to the edge while its down-left continuation was blocked by color 6; color 5 extended down-right to the edge. Earlier errors came from extending only one cell or omitting an exposed ray. Validate each ray’s direction, bounds, blockers, and output dimensions before submission.","path":"arc","scope":"global","reference":{},"arguments":{},"metadata":{"scope":"global"},"source":"refine","created_at":"2026-09-29T13:24:13.286444+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-29T13:27:35.521Z","version":3},"applied":true}],"harnessStatePath":"/home/ubuntu/continual-arc-baselines/.workbench/runs/adhoc-primeagentlearner-1790682233/attempts/9c086a91621049f09b6809851224e395/system/state/agent/harness/harness_state.json","scope":"global"}
